  2) SPP             : ./build_champsim.sh spp
  3) No Prefetcher   : ./build_champsim.sh baseline

L2 Replacement Policies:
  1) LRU             : ./build_champsim.sh baseline
  1) RRIP            : ./build_champsim.sh rrip
  2) IRRIP           : ./build_champsim.sh irrip
  3) Dynamic IRRIP   : ./build_champsim.sh dyn_irrip

L1d Prefetcher + L2 Replacement Policy
  1) SPP + Dynamic IRRIP : ./build_champsim.sh spp+dyn_irrip
  2) IP Stride + RRIP : ./build_champsim.sh ipstride+rrip

Example:
  ./build_champsim.sh baseline

